  "title": "Daily stats (get_stats)",
  "description": "Returned by garminconnect's get_stats(date). 24/7 wellness metrics \u2014 present even on rest days with no logged activity. Consumed by sync_daily_stats.\n\nVerified against: 2026-07-28 (activity day), 2026-07-25 (rest day) \u2014 both full responses, confirming these are day-level not activity-level stats. 2026-08-06 (via automatic drift-check on live data, #68): every field below observed null right after day rollover, before Garmin had computed anything for the new day yet \u2014 now nullable; see per-field notes. Additional fields beyond what's listed here may exist and are tolerated (additionalProperties: true) \u2014 Garmin adding new fields is not a breaking change; a listed field disappearing or changing type is."
